[-] Scout files outside Git and uncommitted, untracked or unpushed repository content on the server =mini-server-home-inventory $Initial read-only scout documented in os/mini-server/INVENTORY.md. Namespace-aware home is about 556 GiB; rootless storage 134 GiB. Git working changes, ahead/local branches, five chezmoi stashes and linked plot worktrees need preservation. Cache/bare-repo/volume review and backup validation remain.$ ^2026-10-01T22:29 #01a0fb16-9622-7339-af03-345c8fd6a234
    >[ ] Review and preserve Git working trees, linked worktrees, local branches and stashes =mini-server-git-recovery $Include ignored/untracked data, common Git metadata, reflogs, LFS/submodules and local bare repositories. Remote-tracking refs are stale observations, not proof of a backup.$ ^2026-10-01T22:47 #01a0fb27-26a6-7019-b927-690d73e85cef
    >[ ] Classify rootless volumes and plan subordinate-ID-safe restore =mini-server-volume-recovery $agent-pi 366 MiB, agent-cargo 234 MiB, agent-target 81 GiB. Preserve potential auth/session state. Arch subuid/subgid allocation is dab:100000:65536. Ordinary du undercounts these files.$ ^2026-10-01T22:47 #01a0fb27-26b4-77ff-b51a-a23ba256f2a5
    >[ ] Approve retain/exclude inventory for build outputs, caches, old VMs and personal data =mini-server-retain-manifest $Do not delete anything. clearhead-core/target is about 225 GiB, but whole home is about 556 GiB and fits the proposed mirror. Preserve unsynced personal data and both knowledge_base directories.$ ^2026-10-01T22:47 #01a0fb27-26c4-71b2-9be4-8e7169820166
